/* win32_msi.inc — msi.dll (Windows Installer) as it behaves on a machine where nothing was installed through MSI: every
   product / feature / component / patch query answers "unknown", enumerations end at once, packages cannot be opened
   (there is no Windows Installer service here), MsiSetInternalUI keeps the UI level, MsiGetFileVersion / MsiGetFileHash
   work on real files (version resource, MD5).  Installer scripts (GOG's Inno Setup [Code] section: MsiQueryProductStateW,
   MsiEnumRelatedProductsW, …) use these to decide whether a redistributable is already present. Included by win32.c after
   win32_version.inc and win32_bcrypt.inc. */
